=2 Walkthrough
* Enter Neptune's Spire in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* Talk to {n:Ghebi Damomohe} at the counter.
* Select the third, blank line of dialogue. {n:Ghebi Damomohe} will inform you that you need either a {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548} **OR** a {@k} {k:Tenshodo application form}.

To get the {@k} {k:Tenshodo application form}:
* Head to {z:Port Bastok} and into Warehouse #2 upper level.
* Once inside, talk to {n:Jabbar} to receive the {@k} {k:Tenshodo application form}.
* Return to {n:Ghebi Damomohe} to receive a {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548} and {k:Tenshodo Member's Card}. You may now freely come and go from the Tenshodo back room.

If you'd prefer to buy a {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548}:
* Search the {z:Auction House} (AH > Others > Misc.) for a {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548} and trade it to {n:Ghebi Damomohe} to complete the quest. Please note that buying the {i:Tenshodo Invite|Tenshodo Invite|548} does NOT bypass the Jeuno {q:Fame|Fame|Fame} required for the quest.

